            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A device is disclosed comprising: an optical sensor; a housing that at least partially encloses the optical sensor; and one or more sensors provided in one or more corners of the housing A method performed by a multi-sensor device is also disclosed, comprising: performing an optical measurement using an optical sensor of the multi-sensor device; and performing another measurement using another sensor of the multi-sensor device; wherein the other sensor is located in a corner of a housing of the optical sensor; and determining a combined measurement value based on the first measurement and the second measurement.</p>
            </abstract>
